","preciseIdentifier":"s:13HeadwireInput16TrackpadGesturesV6OutputO"}],"title":"up(_:at:time:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireInput\/documentation\/HeadwireInput\/TrackpadGestures\/up(_:at:time:)","url":"\/documentation\/headwireinput\/trackpadgestures\/up(_:at:time:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A finger lifts. The first lift of one of the three that armed the stroke decides: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".gesture"},{"type":"text","text":" at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"most once a stroke. Any other finger lifting only leaves the stroke (where it lifted counts, if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it moved)."}]}}}